            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>Provided by the embodiments of the present application are a wireless communication method and device, which may reasonably determine whether a specific channel or signal needs to be detected. The method comprises: detecting a first signal or channel transmitted by a network device; determining whether to detect a second signal or channel according to the detection result of the first signal or channel and the configuration of the relationship between the detection result of the first signal or channel and whether to detect the second signal or channel by the network device.</p>
